    "description": "This funny game contains hundreds of funny jokes and riddles for all ages. Get your joke of the day and laugh out loud.\r\n\r\nIf you like dad jokes or funny riddles you will love this joke book app. \r\n\r\nThis dad joke book is great for for all ages as it contains no dirty jokes aimed only at adults. All the answers to the jokes in the app are viewable at the click of the button.\r\n\r\nPlay everyday and get a funny dad joke of the day.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Are you ready to laugh? Avoid dirty jokes and download this family Funny Jokes and Riddles game today and get your joke of the day!",
